		台詞 = 「...」/「...」/「I wish I knew why I did things like that.」/「Maybe I self-sabotage because I feel that I don't deserve to be happy?」/「Or because I'm so used to things going badly for me that I reject others before they can reject me?」/「I wish I could get help for my behavior... but I don't even understand why I act the way I do.」/「And if nobody can understand what's gone wrong in my head to make me act the way I do, how can they hope to cure it?」
	CASE 18
